meta { name: List sites, type: http, seq: 1 }
get { url: {{adminBase}}/platform/tenants, body: none, auth: none }
headers { Cookie: {{sessionCookie}} }
docs {
  Platform admins only — a site admin gets 403.

  Deliberately unscoped: the caller has no tenant of their own and picking one
  is the point. A separate shape from the dashboard's tenant summary, so future
  dashboard metrics do not silently join this response.
}
